{"uuid": "32c1fc03-c029-4fdd-b36d-2d5d32378ea1", "message": "1101100100001111110100110001101101011011100110010011010001010010", "container": "In the digital era, the dynamics of friendship have undergone significant changes. With the advent of social media platforms, individuals can now connect with friends from various parts of the world without physical proximity. This has led to a shift in the way friendships are formed and maintained. Online interactions, such as chatting and video calls, have become the new norm for communication, replacing traditional face-to-face meetings. While this has brought convenience and an expanded social network, it has also diluted the meaning of friendship, making it more superficial and less intimate. Nonetheless, the digital era has undeniably transformed the landscape of friendship, for better or worse.", "encoded_message": "During the technological age, the mechanisms of companionship have experienced major shifts. With the emergence of societal media outlets, people can now engage with peers from different regions of the world without bodily closeness. This has led to a change in the manner alliances are created and continued. Virtual interactions, such as messaging and video calls, have become the latest standard for interaction, supplanting conventional in-person sessions. While this has brought comfort and an extended social circle, it has also reduced the importance of friendship, making it more superficial and less intimate. Nonetheless, the digital era has undeniably transformed the landscape of friendship, for better or worse.", "secret_key": [{"In": {"0": "Within", "1": "During"}}, {"the": {"0": "the", "1": "the"}}, {"digital": {"00": "electronic", "01": "computerized", "10": "technological", "11": "virtual"}}, {"era": {"00": "period", "01": "time", "10": "epoch", "11": "age"}}, {"the": {"0": "the", "1": "the"}}, {"dynamics": {"00": "mechanisms", "01": "forces", "10": "processes", "11": "interactions"}}, {"of": {"0": "